Model weights and other model artifacts
  Bundled in the container image. They are part of the surya-ocr 0.17.1 distribution,
  which is GNU GPL v3.0 or later, and are fetched from https://models.datalab.to at image
  build time. Versioned checkpoint paths (for example s3://layout/2025_09_23) come from the
  installed surya-ocr release, so the artifact set is fixed by the package version rather
  than resolved at run time.

Runtime dependencies installed by the container image (PyTorch, torchvision,
pdftext, pypdfium2, poppler-utils, tesseract-ocr, the ASP.NET Core runtime and
others) remain under their own licences. `pip list` and `pip show <package>`
inside the image name each one.
